import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 575 | Acceleration Domain | Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Cosmic-Level Beings","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 575 | Acceleration Domain | Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Cosmic-Level Beings","no":575,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Origin Realm","Cosmic-Level Being","Realm Adaptation","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","17-Plane-Transcendent Strongest Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0575_模块3-加速域-本源境适配.md","filePath":"en/0575_模块3-加速域-本源境适配.md"}'),n={name:"en/0575_模块3-加速域-本源境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,u){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-575-acceleration-domain-origin-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-cosmic-level-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 575 | Acceleration Domain | Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Cosmic-Level Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-575-acceleration-domain-origin-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-cosmic-level-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 575 | Acceleration Domain | Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Cosmic-Level Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 17; Benchmark library: Entry 574</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-the-cultivator-becomes-a-cosmic-level-being" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when the cultivator becomes a &quot;cosmic-level being&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-the-cultivator-becomes-a-cosmic-level-being" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when the cultivator becomes a &quot;cosmic-level being&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After World-Creation, the cultivator enters Origin Realm. This is the nine realms&#39; ninth realm, and the officially defined &quot;cosmic-level being&quot; threshold (Documents 14, 17). The Origin cultivator is no longer &quot;a person cultivating within the universe,&quot; but <strong>a being resonating with the universe&#39;s origin</strong> — his consciousness may cover the whole plane, his will may affect plane-level law operation, he himself is the candidate for Plane-Transcendent. A cultivator at this realm already stands at the apex of the nine-realm mortal-and-sage system.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in Origin Realm become the highest test: anti-predation axiom requires cosmic-level power never used for predation; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires cosmic-level beings serve Myriad Ranks, not rule them; collective ascension axiom requires the Origin cultivator bear the responsibility of &quot;lifting Myriad Ranks to ascend together&quot;; causal self-discipline axiom requires cosmic-level operations supervised to the extreme by multi-layer supervision; law-first axiom takes &quot;Origin adapted flow&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-cosmic-level-beings-must-limit-acceleration" tabindex="-1">I. Why Cosmic-Level Beings Must &quot;Limit Acceleration&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-cosmic-level-beings-must-limit-acceleration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Cosmic-Level Beings Must &quot;Limit Acceleration&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin cultivator&#39;s power is already large enough to affect the whole plane. At this point giving him unrestricted acceleration equals letting a person who can move planets run a hundred-meter sprint in a crowded downtown — energetically completely impermissible. Thus Origin&#39;s acceleration-gear design principle is different from all previous realms: <strong>not &quot;how to accelerate,&quot; but &quot;how to limit acceleration.&quot;</strong></p><p>Origin acceleration gear&#39;s core constraints:</p><ul><li><strong>Total Duration Cap</strong>: the Origin cultivator&#39;s total duration in the acceleration domain per year may not exceed 1% of real time;</li><li><strong>Operation Radius Limit</strong>: consciousness activity radius in the acceleration domain may not exceed 1/1000 of his own origin structure;</li><li><strong>Double-Layer Supervision</strong>: besides the Alaya Network, the Anchor Supervisory Committee dispatches dedicated personnel to watch Origin acceleration operations;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank Hearing</strong>: any Origin acceleration operation exceeding 500× flow must undergo Myriad-Rank hearing.</li></ul><p>This constraint&#39;s logic is simple: the greater the power, the more dangerous the acceleration, because one thought of yours under hundredfold flow affects a million beings.</p><h2 id="ii-origin-acceleration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Origin Acceleration-Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-origin-acceleration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Origin Acceleration-Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Scenario</th><th>Flow Cap</th><th>Approval Level</th><th>Supervision Intensity</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Daily Deduction</td><td>100×</td><td>Automatic approval</td><td>Alaya Network</td></tr><tr><td>Law Revision</td><td>500×</td><td>Anchor Council</td><td>Double-layer supervision</td></tr><tr><td>Plane-Level Engineering</td><td>1000×</td><td>Myriad-Rank hearing</td><td>Triple-layer supervision</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-Origin Coordination</td><td>10000×</td><td>Myriad-Rank hearing + multi-origin co-signature</td><td>Full-dimension supervision</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Especially emphasized: the Origin cultivator <strong>must not</strong> self-accelerate without approval. Each of his accelerations is a civilizational-level decision, must follow process. This彻底 breaks from the old era&#39;s predatory logic of &quot;the strong do as they please.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-cosmic-level-power-s-time-responsibility" tabindex="-1">III. Cosmic-Level Power&#39;s Time Responsibility <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-cosmic-level-power-s-time-responsibility" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Cosmic-Level Power&#39;s Time Responsibility&quot;">​</a></h2><p>While enjoying acceleration dividends, the Origin cultivator bears cosmic-level time responsibility:</p><ul><li>Results he deduces in the acceleration domain must be used for Myriad Ranks, may not be hoarded;</li><li>If his acceleration operation affects Myriad Ranks, he must accept the Anchor Supervisory Committee&#39;s accountability;</li><li>He himself is part of the temporal-paradox prevention system; once causal overheating found, he must be the first to slow.</li></ul><p>Plane-Transcendent four-dimensional assessment (Power 40 / Mind 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15, Document 17) directly lands here: the Origin cultivator&#39;s &quot;Responsibility&quot; dimension accounts for 15%, and time responsibility is the core of the Responsibility dimension.</p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-cosmic-overlord" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Cosmic Overlord&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-cosmic-overlord" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Cosmic Overlord&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, an Origin-level strong one&#39;s typical behavior is &quot;self-proclaiming cosmic overlord&quot;: treating the whole universe as private property, Myriad-Rank beings as ants. This behavior&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>It uses cosmic-level power for personal pleasure and rule, the greatest energy-level waste;</li><li>It trains &quot;tyrants,&quot; not &quot;guardians&quot;;</li><li>It ultimately inevitably leads to Myriad-Rank rebellion, civilizational reversal.</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Origin acceleration gear takes &quot;limit acceleration&quot; as the core; from time allocation makes &quot;cosmic overlord&quot; fundamentally unworkable in process — you want to rule the universe at hundredfold speed? First pass the Myriad-Rank hearing.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: strictly limit cosmic-level power&#39;s acceleration within 1% duration, avoiding the law network being dragged down by a single strong one&#39;s idling</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Origin acceleration must be approved, must be heard, must feed back to Myriad Ranks; from process eliminates &quot;cosmic overlord&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Origin strong ones self-proclaim Heavenly Emperor; the universe is private property; Heng Yuan&#39;s Origin cultivator is Myriad Ranks&#39; guardian, bearing time responsibility</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the Origin channel opens to Myriad Ranks; plant-spirit origin, planet-consciousness origin also included in four-dimensional assessment</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Origin acceleration parameters, approval process, supervision rules all public; this is the apex segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-the-origin-cultivator-s-annual-slow-down-report" tabindex="-1">VI. The Origin Cultivator&#39;s Annual Slow-Down Report <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-the-origin-cultivator-s-annual-slow-down-report" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. The Origin Cultivator&#39;s Annual Slow-Down Report&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin cultivator annually must submit a slow-down report to the Anchor Supervisory Committee: how much time he used in the acceleration domain over the past year, what he did, what impact he had on Myriad Ranks. After Myriad-Rank rotating review, the report is public. This report is not formalism, but makes the cosmic-level being every year re-acknowledge himself as Myriad Ranks&#39; public servant. In the predatory-faction system, Origin-level strong ones never report to anyone; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s annual slow-down report is the hard evidence of cosmic-level power accepting Myriad-Rank accountability.</p><h2 id="vii-bidirectional-connection-between-the-origin-cultivator-and-mortal-life" tabindex="-1">VII. Bidirectional Connection Between the Origin Cultivator and Mortal Life <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-bidirectional-connection-between-the-origin-cultivator-and-mortal-life" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Bidirectional Connection Between the Origin Cultivator and Mortal Life&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Although the Origin cultivator descends as a mortal, his cosmic-level consciousness is not closed. The Alaya Network establishes a bidirectional connection between his mortal life and his cosmic-level duties: when events in mortal life needing his cosmic-level judgment appear, the network automatically prompts; when in cosmic-level duties he finds details needing mortal perspective, the network automatically accesses his mortal journal. This bidirectional connection makes descending not evasion of duty, but injecting mortal warmth into duty.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Origin Realm is the nine-realm system&#39;s apex. The Origin Acceleration Domain here is no longer &quot;an accelerometer rewarding the strong,&quot; but &quot;a time gate constraining the strong.&quot; A cosmic-level being willing to accept this constraint precisely proves he deserves this realm. <strong>True strength is not being able to speed up whenever you want, but knowing when you must slow down.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./574_模块3-加速域-创世境适配.html">574-Acceleration-Domain World-Creation Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane-Transcendent Strongest Standard</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const p=i(n,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
